# Generated SQL bundles are committed deliberately (see supabase/dist/README.md).
# The negation is required: `dist/` above matches any directory of that name at
# any depth, including this one, and git will not descend into an excluded
# directory — so without this line the bundles are silently absent from the repo
# and the only copy anyone has is whatever was last pasted somewhere.
!supabase/dist/
